      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "What is the best free alternative to Notion in 2026?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Obsidian is the best free alternative to Notion for individuals who want local-first, offline note-taking. Obsidian's free tier includes unlimited notes, backlinks, graph view, and 4,000+ community plugins. The trade-off is that Obsidian stores files locally as Markdown, so real-time collaboration requires a paid sync service. For team collaboration, ClickUp's free tier is the closest Notion alternative with tasks, docs, and databases." } },
