        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can Coda replace Notion for team documentation?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Coda can replace Notion for teams that need interactive documents with real formulas, buttons, and automations. Coda's formula language is more powerful than Notion's, and its doc-as-an-app model lets you build lightweight internal tools. However, Notion has a larger template ecosystem, better search, and broader adoption. Coda is best for teams that outgrow Notion's formula limitations." } },
